{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15479","headline":"酬前驾部员外郎苗发 · 李端","name":"酬前驾部员外郎苗发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马融方直校，阅简复持铅。\n素业高风继，青春壮思全。\n论文多在夜，宿寺不虚年。\n自署区中职，同荒郭外田。\n山邻三径绝，野意八行传。\n煮玉矜新法，留符识旧仙。\n涵苔溪溜浅，摇浪竹桥悬。\n复洞潜栖燕，疎杨半翳蝉。\n咏歌虽有和，云锦独成妍。\n应以冯唐老，相讥示此篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}